{{features_list}}

## Installation

### Using mpak (Recommended)

```bash
# Configure your {{service_name}} API key
mpak config set @nimblebraininc/{{name}} api_key=your_api_key_here

# Run the server
mpak run @nimblebraininc/{{name}}
```

### Manual Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/NimbleBrainInc/mcp-{{name}}.git
cd mcp-{{name}}

# Install dependencies with uv
uv sync

# Set your API key
export {{env_var_name}}=your_api_key_here

# Run the server
uv run python -m mcp_{{name_underscore}}.server
```

## Configuration

### Getting Your {{service_name}} API Key

{{api_key_instructions}}

### Claude Desktop Configuration

Add to your `~/.claude/settings.json`:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "{{name}}": {
      "command": "mpak",
      "args": ["run", "@nimblebraininc/{{name}}"]
    }
  }
}
```

