## Development

```bash
# Install dev dependencies
uv sync --dev

# Run tests
uv run pytest tests/ -v

# Format code
uv run ruff format src/ tests/

# Lint
uv run ruff check src/ tests/

# Type check
uv run ty check src/

# Run all checks
make check
```

